  "The blade caught the first light. The six friends crossed the gate in time.": "刀片抓住了第一道光。 六個朋友及時趕過大門。",
  "The feather floated against the wind. There was a gaping hole in the sky curtain.": "羽毛隨風飄揚。 天窗上有一個大洞。",
  "The first drop of water caused the dry, stiff gears under the tower to spin again.": "第一滴水導致塔底下乾燥、堅硬的齒輪再次旋轉。",
  "The last part in the box fits the door winch.": "盒子裡的最後一部分適合門絞盤。",
  "Golden petals sprang under the archers' feet. Raise the firing line beyond the wall.": "金色的花瓣從弓箭手的腳下跳了出來。 將火線抬高到牆外。",
  "A stone platform led the team up to a balcony where the stairs were broken.": "一個石頭平台把團隊帶到一個陽台，那裡的樓梯被打破了。",
  "The angle of the mirror bends the light beam back into the seal that emitted it.": "鏡子的角度將光束彎曲回發射的密封圈。",
  "Repeated letters on the wall reveal which line is the command to close the door.": "牆上的重複字母顯示哪一行是關閉門的命令。",
  "When the machine stepped onto the frozen ground The joint stopped.": "當機器踩到冰凍的地面時，接頭停止了。",
  "The hunter's eyes caught the moment the armor plate was revealed. before releasing the arrow": "盔甲板露出的那一刻，獵人的目光都抓住了。 在釋放箭頭之前",
  "Sparks traced the blade's grooves. Go to extinguish the character at the other end.": "火花追蹤刀片的凹槽。 去消滅另一端的角色。",
  "The tassel on the amulet shakes, warning the wind on the bridge will reverse direction.": "護身符上的流蘇搖晃，警告橋上的風會反轉。",
  "Arrow at the top of the tower The flames pointed out the target for those who followed.": "塔頂的箭頭 火焰為跟隨的人指出目標。",
  "Baron Bunny dances in the middle of the courtyard. As everyone passed by the wall": "兔男爵在院子中間跳舞。 當每個人都經過牆壁",
  "Sharp scales inserted into joints. The seal circle did not rotate completely.": "尖銳的鱗片插入關節。 密封圈沒有完全旋轉。",
  "Ushi stomped his feet in front of the checkpoint. The entire line of guards turned towards him.": "烏西踩在檢查站前。 整個守衛都轉向他。",
  "The baton lifts up the entire beam blocking the way.": "指揮棒抬起整個橫樑，阻擋了道路。",
  "The sickle's scythe caught the light string overhead and tore it apart.": "鐮刀的鐮刀抓住了頭頂的輕繩，把它撕開了。",
  "Intelligence from the House of the Hearth reveals a secret route beyond Celestia’s sight.": "壁爐之家的情報揭示了一條以外的塞拉斯提亞視線之外的秘密路線。",
  "The fang marks on the vine's bark indicate that the tree still has antivenom sap.": "藤蔓樹皮上的尖牙表示這棵樹仍然有抗蛇毒血清。",
  "The smell of herbs helps the forward unit continue walking through the fog.": "草藥的氣味有助於前方單位繼續穿過霧氣。",
  "The water revolves around the flag bearer. Receive flak from all sides": "水圍繞著旗手。 受到四面八方的抨擊",
  "The same singing line brings lost people back together.": "同樣的歌唱讓迷路的人重新聚在一起。",
  "A single slash cuts through the waves crashing across the bow of the ship.": "一道斜線穿過船頭的海浪。",
  "The flag on the mast told the last ship that it was their turn to break through the blockade.": "桅杆上的旗幟告訴最後一艘船，輪到他們打破封鎖了。",
  "The circle of lights on the ground became a gathering point as the entire courtyard went dark.": "隨著整個庭院變暗，地面上的一圈燈就變成了一個聚集點。",
  "Cloth wrapped around palm This allows the person to continue pulling the rope until the last person comes up.": "包裹在手掌上的布可以讓人繼續拉繩子，直到最後一個人出現。",
  "The face of the shield is tilted to receive the beam of light. Deflect it from the shelter door.": "盾牌的表面傾斜以接收光束。 將它從避難所門偏轉。",
  "One pitcher of water is shared until the last guard turns before the gates open.": "一個水罐被共享，直到最後一個守衛在大門打開之前轉動。",
  "Pictures from the front line reveal that the top of the tower darkened before every shot.": "前線的圖片顯示，每次拍攝前，塔的頂部都會變暗。",
